{
  "name": "Way Out",
  "short_name": "Way Out",
  "description": "A synthwave arrow puzzle. A board of any shape, packed edge to edge with tangled arrows; each one can only leave when its lane to the edge is clear, so they have to go in the right order. Sixty levels across thirteen shapes, a daily tangle, hearts to keep and stars to earn. No ads, no purchases, no timers.",
